          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-steel-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every Haonuo hydraulic press can cold press — cold and hot pressing differ in <b>seed preparation, not the machine</b>. The HN426 (500 t, 42 MPa cake pressure) is the cold-press flagship for premium oil; the HN480B is a made-to-order 600 t variant for the hardest cold-press materials. The HN325 and HN365 are the usual choices when most production is hot-pressed.</p>
        </details>
